<speak>Good afternoon, Mr Tan, Rachel Lim here. Thank you for setting aside the time for our telephone appointment. Is the line comfortable for you at your end? I have kept this part of the afternoon free, so there is no need to rush through your paperwork. If you need to move somewhere quieter or take a moment to find a page, just let me know. We can keep a measured pace, as we usually do when we speak.</speak>